  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-codec-http3 4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-codec-http3 4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-44892, CVE-2026-48748, and CVE-2026-56816.\n\nCVE-2026-44892: Netty has a Vulnerable Default Configuration Which Leads to Denial of Service via Unbounded HTTP/3 Header Size\n\nCVE-2026-48748: Netty HTTP/3 QPACK Blocked Streams Memory Exhaustion\n\nCVE-2026-56816: Netty: Memory Exhaustion via HTTP/3 Reserved Frame Types\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-codec-http3 4.2.13.Final-rhlw-00001 from Maven Central.",
